@startuml 06-tool-approval-sequence
!include theme.puml
title Tool Runtime：内部权限判定与沙箱执行边界

autonumber
box "Agent Kernel" LC_KERNEL
participant "Agent Loop Engine" as LOOP
participant "Tool Registry" as REGISTRY
participant "Tool Runtime" as TOOL_RUNTIME
participant "Permission Approval Port\nKernel 内部" as APPROVAL
participant "Tool Execution Guard" as GUARD
participant "Sandbox Planner" as PLANNER
participant "SandboxPort" as SANDBOX
participant "ToolProviderPort" as TOOL_PORT
end box

participant "受限 Tool Provider" as TOOL_PROVIDER LC_ADAPTER
participant "授权资源" as RESOURCE LC_INFRASTRUCTURE

LOOP -> REGISTRY : resolve(tool_name, frozen version)
REGISTRY --> LOOP : ToolDescriptor + JSON Schema + 隔离要求
LOOP -> TOOL_RUNTIME : request(candidate, frozen run scope)
TOOL_RUNTIME -> TOOL_RUNTIME : Schema 校验 + 参数/资源规范化
TOOL_RUNTIME -> APPROVAL : evaluate(context, run scope, permission request)
APPROVAL -> APPROVAL : 权限求交集 + 规则判定 + 审计
APPROVAL --> TOOL_RUNTIME : ALLOW(grant) / DENY(reason)

alt ALLOW(grant)
  TOOL_RUNTIME -> APPROVAL : revalidate(grant)
  APPROVAL --> TOOL_RUNTIME : VALID / INVALID
  TOOL_RUNTIME -> GUARD : execute(validated grant, candidate)
  GUARD -> PLANNER : plan(tool isolation requirements, grant)
  PLANNER --> GUARD : SandboxRequest（Grant 的子集）
  GUARD -> SANDBOX : create(SandboxRequest)
  SANDBOX --> GUARD : SandboxHandle
  GUARD -> TOOL_PORT : execute(AuthorizedToolRequest, SandboxHandle)
  TOOL_PORT -> TOOL_PROVIDER : Provider 私有调用
  TOOL_PROVIDER -> RESOURCE : capability-scoped access
  RESOURCE --> TOOL_PROVIDER : bounded result
  TOOL_PROVIDER --> TOOL_PORT : ToolResult / 稳定技术错误
  TOOL_PORT --> GUARD : 规范化 ToolResult
  GUARD --> LOOP : ToolResult
else DENY(reason)
  TOOL_RUNTIME --> LOOP : ToolDenied 进入下一轮上下文
end

note over TOOL_RUNTIME,APPROVAL
  Permission Approval 只由 ToolRuntime 在 Kernel 内部调用；
  不进入 AgentGateway 或 JSONL 方法目录。
end note

note over APPROVAL,SANDBOX
  Approval 回答“允许什么”，Sandbox 强制“只能这样执行”。
  Approval 不创建沙箱；Sandbox 不能扩大 Grant。
end note

note over LOOP,TOOL_PORT
  Provider 只提供执行机制，不能定义权限或申请扩权。
  首版仅注册 list_files / read_text / search_text。
  约束：UP-AGT-006、UP-AGT-009、UP-SEC-001
end note
@enduml
